[open] Issue #6: 05: persist tiles and flush them on an alarm
  Author: @mvhenten
  Status: OPEN
  URL: https://github.com/mvhenten/stallion/issues/6

  Description:
    ## Delivers

    - A table `tile(level, tx, ty, doc_state, updated_at)`.
    - A table `object_index(level, tx, ty, object_id, bbox)`.
    - An alarm that flushes about every 5 s.
    - Update compaction.
    - Lazy tile load on wake.
    - Migrations.

    ## Touches

    `crates/server`

    ## Tests

    - `cargo test` covers compaction.
    - Vitest runs against `wrangler dev`. It writes, restarts, reloads and checks alarm batching.

    Needs his approval before implementation: the table schema.

    Blocked by: #5
